/**
 * seedBrcClauses — seeds the clause library for a compliance standard.
 * Libraries: BRCGS Packaging Issue 7 (representative subset), ISO 9001:2015,
 * ISO 14001:2015 and ISO 45001:2018 (paraphrased clause summaries — consult
 * the published standards for authoritative text).
 * Admin-only. Idempotent — will not duplicate if clauses for the standard
 * already exist. Call with: { standard: "iso_9001" } etc.
 */
